 GENERAL:

   Alt+F4 / ESC / Q /  
   / X / F11 / RMB     Exit BeatDrop
   F1                  show/hide help

 PRESETS:

   F2 / LMB            show/hide preset name
   SPACE / RIGHT       soft cut to next preset
   H                   hard cut to next preset
   BACKSPACE / LEFT    go back to previous preset
   SCROLL LOCK         lock/unlock current preset
   R                   toggle random/sequential preset order 
   L                   load specific preset
   M                   show/hide preset-editing Menu
   S                   save new preset
   A                   do random mini-mash-up
   D                   toggle comp/warp shader locks
